   Pack: alu-alu blister of 10 tablets
   Price: CHF 0.2280
   MOQ: 500 packs, lead time 60 days

4) Statinex 20 (atorvastatin 20 mg film-coated tablet)
   Pack: alu-alu blister of 30 tablets
   Price: CHF 0.9270
   MOQ: 50,000 packs, lead time 42 days

5) Helvtld 300 (tenofovir disoproxil fumarate + lamivudine + dolutegravir 300=
